{"title":"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Trigonometry)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Trigonometry)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Angle_Bisector_Theorem)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Angle Bisector Theorem)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equations of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13a902eb6a24cf493a2732badd0d151fb4f7672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/1/0d1fe0afdea68630af2bda225ce5f2978b5ba0be.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"11\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/8/4f84eec6f29cb5ff7956ced042071e8d1bd2ca10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=nx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"11\" />, respectively. Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> makes twice as large of an angle with the horizontal (measured counterclockwise from the positive x-axis) as does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13a902eb6a24cf493a2732badd0d151fb4f7672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />, and that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13a902eb6a24cf493a2732badd0d151fb4f7672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> is not horizontal, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150c08478d63c3d2f5cc0de4222ea9183673d7ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn$\" width=\"26\" height=\"8\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/1/ab1081e01ec723a9cc420357c40a4fc043c1ba05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\ \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(B)} \\ -\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} \\qquad \\text{(C)} \\ 2 \\qquad \\text{(D)} \\ -2 \\qquad \\text{(E)} \\ \\text{not uniquely determined}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"584\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Trigonometry.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Trigonometry)\">Solution 1 (Trigonometry)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Trigonometry)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13a902eb6a24cf493a2732badd0d151fb4f7672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358040518a81a08c7e45f1191122214294459ac4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf281b877b370252c08b7774dbb0117f8036c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = (0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7110545e23e3d67ded87cfed66ae62d56d2c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = (1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3fa22e1aeed4cfc2aafe2ce0d7c3d0f1fe46586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = (1,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/c/cac9e045a9edb95d74abce177f9982185f741763.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = (1,m)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"88\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/6/a16db85396b91e1daae12e5444228028b00ff6c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\theta = \\angle AOB = \\angle BOC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"171\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/f/15f4ed73d417dab02e08f44bec9b9deed6f14ca8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = \\tan 2\\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"89\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c013487949270223e9cfbb0a18fc08542f2da0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\tan \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />.  \n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358040518a81a08c7e45f1191122214294459ac4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/1/441fa8d65521392c9814291088cdbdb3f38c51a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan 2\\theta = 4\\tan \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"14\" />. By the tangent double-angle formula, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/3/133964bd569a3a5f9f3d961481de7a757b08f073.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{2\\tan \\theta}{1-\\tan^2 \\theta} = 4\\tan \\theta$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"158\" height=\"41\" />. Cross-multiplying and collecting terms on one side yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/9/5897e6ee67faaa78291c528ebdb9fe21bd91236d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4\\tan^3 \\theta - 2\\tan\\theta = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" />, which factors as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/3/5035de944536a00a233db93159cb56c23cee1db4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\tan \\theta(2\\tan^2\\theta - 1) = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"189\" height=\"21\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/f/6dfbd13a8219144b35c4b27a4636051691b36e52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tan\\theta = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6ae1ba7219f584f7fe8961778fa9fed2ae94eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n(2n^2-1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"128\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>Since line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> is not horizontal, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/3/df3f9bd7ea38f7336f5a64109d4053d775858f28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"17\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/5/b9556feea06cf75e404b17c1ea240570b17047aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2n^2 - 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"18\" />, and thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/1/0a1d31cad40e0308a3aae354d65a46c92eacd155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^2 = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"38\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/14075bdbb1dc3219c7bb72d43001267b170db40e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn = 4n^2 = 4 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2} = \\boxed{(\\textbf{C}) \\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"218\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>-e_power_pi_times_i, edited by j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Angle_Bisector_Theorem.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Angle_Bisector_Theorem)\">Solution 2 (Angle Bisector Theorem)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Angle Bisector Theorem)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/2/3f22b669e4803ae525cf8120ca251e2eab025872.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> times the slope of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/3/e13a902eb6a24cf493a2732badd0d151fb4f7672.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$L_2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358040518a81a08c7e45f1191122214294459ac4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 4n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/f/6cf281b877b370252c08b7774dbb0117f8036c84.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$O = (0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/7/0b7110545e23e3d67ded87cfed66ae62d56d2c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A = (1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/f/e3fa22e1aeed4cfc2aafe2ce0d7c3d0f1fe46586.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = (1,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"83\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/8/73898d1e3c651d1a753391b0ecc5cfb5d4e1a4b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = (1,m) = (1, 4n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"163\" height=\"20\" />.  By the Angle Bisector Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/0/040df1e02419613a74aa54295af4b5ab65272fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{OC}{OA} = \\frac{BC}{AB}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"92\" height=\"39\" />.  That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/d/35db836291f11f6f77736f279562d3ebfb12df06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OC = \\frac{3n}{n} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>By the Pythagorean Theorem, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/c/40ca2f40335034e8007a02396d8f849f0f1302e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AC = \\sqrt{3^2-1^2} = 2\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"182\" height=\"21\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/1/2413d7faf2cca3a057941b2540338798d0ce2c2c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m = 2\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"75\" height=\"21\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/9/439bbbafc7c76bc57a1c8da4a823eb59aed171f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\frac{2\\sqrt{2}}{4} = \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"127\" height=\"43\" />.  Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/1/a211b96d376daad706564160c7a3d2efdc6f98c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$mn = \\left(2\\sqrt{2}\\right)\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\right) = \\boxed{(\\textbf{C}) \\ 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"245\" height=\"55\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME\" title=\"1980 AHSME\">1980 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1980 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1980\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1980_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1980 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017173213\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.073 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 316/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9191/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.863      1 -total\n 55.80%    7.177      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 41.83%    5.381      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:13177:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017173213 and revision id 257567. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}